  "description": "This year Tiësto is sensing a frisson in the air and is feeling more connected to trance than ever before, but it’s not the trance that he started out playing — this is the new trance of 2026 that’s really got him excited again. “It’s fresh,” he says, while revealing that he’s working on a new album release and pondering a change of name for his label. Amongst his legendary sets of the summer played a big set at Creamfields, and he returns to Vegas in November for a slew of dates, as well as holding a banger of an NYE party there to see in 2027.",
